WEBVTT

00:01.061 --> 00:02.191
[Mizuki grunts]

00:02.521 --> 00:05.941
<i>Damn it. You can totally see</i>
<i>my binder in this dress!</i>

00:06.031 --> 00:06.981
-[screams]
-<i>No.</i>

00:07.071 --> 00:09.071
<i>I just felt</i>
<i>my soul leave my body.</i>

00:09.151 --> 00:11.741
<i>There's no way I can take</i>
<i>this stupid thing off</i>.

00:11.821 --> 00:13.991
<i>But I can't exactly</i>
<i>keep it on either.</i>

00:14.071 --> 00:15.581
-[YAO] How's it fit, Ashiya?
-Uh?

00:15.661 --> 00:18.291
Do you think we'll need
to adjust the length a little?

00:18.371 --> 00:21.001
[MIZUKI] Actually, I don't.
Looks like it's about right.

00:21.081 --> 00:22.631
Great to hear.

00:22.711 --> 00:25.091
So, I can mark
Ashiya's dress as good to go.

00:25.171 --> 00:26.841
[MIZUKI]
<i>There's no other choice.</i>

00:26.921 --> 00:28.841
<i>I'll just have to go</i>
<i>"au natural!"</i>

00:31.221 --> 00:32.721
-We were waiting for-- Uh?
-Uh?

00:32.801 --> 00:35.471
[NANBA] Wow,
you pull that off well.

00:36.511 --> 00:37.771
[MIZUKI] <i>Fingers crossed!</i>

00:37.851 --> 00:39.731
<i>Please, let me</i>
<i>get away with this!</i>

00:40.771 --> 00:43.191
I can't believe how much
you look like a real woman.

00:43.271 --> 00:44.231
You could have fooled me.

00:44.311 --> 00:45.611
[Mizuki chuckles nervously]

00:45.691 --> 00:47.691
[NAKAO] That padded bra
certainly understood

00:47.781 --> 00:49.741
-the assignment.
-[chuckles] I guess.

00:51.071 --> 00:53.111
[SANO] Here, these are yours.

00:53.201 --> 00:54.201
Oh, thanks.

00:54.281 --> 00:56.081
So you're the shoe guy?
Funny job.

00:56.161 --> 00:58.121
They asked me to help
if I had the time.

00:59.201 --> 01:00.581
-And, uh...
-[MIZUKI] Uh?

01:00.661 --> 01:01.871
...by the way...

01:03.791 --> 01:05.251
that dress looks good on you.

01:05.331 --> 01:06.631
[Mizuki gasps]

01:07.551 --> 01:09.881
<i>Whoa, did he just flirt with me?</i>

01:10.551 --> 01:14.131
<i>My ears are on fire.</i>
<i>I'm such a dork.</i>

01:14.221 --> 01:16.141
-[KANNA] Hey, Mizuki.
-Uh?

01:16.221 --> 01:18.891
For you. These are the stockings
you'll wear for the dance.

01:18.971 --> 01:20.351
Here you go.

01:20.431 --> 01:21.521
[MIZUKI] What's up?

01:21.601 --> 01:22.981
There's something different
about you.

01:23.061 --> 01:26.151
Huh? Oops.
Guess I'm an open book.

01:26.231 --> 01:27.731
Oh, come on, Kanna.

01:27.821 --> 01:29.441
You know you can trust me.

01:29.531 --> 01:31.401
I don't know. I shouldn't!

01:31.491 --> 01:33.201
Okay, I'll tell you.

01:33.281 --> 01:34.741
Yesterday, Megumi asked me

01:34.821 --> 01:36.621
to be his dance partner
at the ball.

01:36.701 --> 01:38.411
Wow, Kanna, that's incredible.

01:38.491 --> 01:40.081
Nice going, gorilla boy.

01:40.161 --> 01:41.411
-[Tennoji sneezes]
-Uh?

01:41.501 --> 01:44.791
How to put this?
It's such a delicate affair.

01:44.871 --> 01:48.341
I think you've got a real shot
at being crowned queen.

01:49.711 --> 01:50.711
[speaking German]

01:50.801 --> 01:52.671
[in English] I beg you,
would you care to dance wi--

01:52.761 --> 01:54.301
Get lost, you creep.

01:54.381 --> 01:55.801
But... [speaking in German]

01:56.301 --> 01:57.931
[Kanna gasps]

01:58.011 --> 02:00.931
Oh, beautiful raven-haired
mistress of the dark sky,

02:01.021 --> 02:02.101
would you care to--

02:02.181 --> 02:03.941
Get your grubby paws
off her now!

02:04.021 --> 02:06.811
Kanna is my blushing fiancée,
you got that, you fool?

02:06.901 --> 02:07.941
[all gasp]

02:08.021 --> 02:09.441
[ALL] Whoa!

02:09.571 --> 02:11.111
[HIMEJIMA] What in the eff?

02:12.031 --> 02:14.321
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:42.031 --> 03:43.331
I'M SO HAPPY!

03:43.411 --> 03:44.451
[MIZUKI] And then...

03:44.541 --> 03:46.331
he goes and spills all the beans

03:46.411 --> 03:48.331
in front
of every single person there.

03:48.421 --> 03:51.421
Amazing. You should have seen
the look on his face after that.

03:51.501 --> 03:52.711
[laughs]

03:53.251 --> 03:55.881
I'm surprised she'd go
for a meathead like him.

03:55.961 --> 03:57.971
-She's so nice.
-Right?

03:59.511 --> 04:02.391
Time flies.
Tomorrow's the big day, huh?

04:02.891 --> 04:04.471
Yeah, I guess it is.

04:05.391 --> 04:07.021
[MIZUKI] Say no if you want,

04:07.101 --> 04:09.771
but I was wondering
if I could ask you a huge favor.

04:09.851 --> 04:10.851
[SANO] Yeah, what?

04:11.651 --> 04:15.111
It's just... I was hoping
you'd dance with me,

04:15.611 --> 04:16.821
right now.

04:17.191 --> 04:19.701
[gasps nervously]
<i>I really asked him.</i>

04:19.781 --> 04:21.361
-Sure, why not?
-[gasps]

04:21.451 --> 04:22.781
♪

04:30.161 --> 04:31.581
[Mizuki gasps]

04:31.671 --> 04:33.171
[SANO] And a-one...

04:34.541 --> 04:35.671
[both grunt]

04:35.751 --> 04:36.671
[thudding]

04:36.761 --> 04:38.011
♪

04:39.801 --> 04:41.431
[breathes softly]

04:41.511 --> 04:42.931
[exhales softly]

04:43.761 --> 04:44.681
♪

04:45.141 --> 04:46.931
Awesome, that helped, thanks!

04:47.021 --> 04:49.101
I'd better hit the sack!

04:49.521 --> 04:50.941
Good night!

04:51.271 --> 04:53.691
[panting]

04:54.861 --> 04:56.731
<i>I need to calm down.</i>

04:57.611 --> 05:00.571
[HIBARI] <i>Let me welcome you,</i>
<i>ladies and gentlemen.</i>

05:00.651 --> 05:02.861
<i>Tonight, we uphold</i>
<i>a time-honored tradition</i>

05:02.951 --> 05:05.081
<i>between St. Blossom</i>
<i>and Osaka High.</i>

05:05.531 --> 05:08.701
<i>Dance the night away and enjoy</i>
<i>yourselves to the fullest.</i>

05:08.791 --> 05:11.291
Why is she the only one who gets
to wear a special dress?

05:11.371 --> 05:13.461
-Talk about a rigged game.
-[chuckles]

05:13.541 --> 05:14.751
♪

05:17.881 --> 05:19.591
-[Nakatsu gasps]
-[SANO] Hmm?

05:21.511 --> 05:22.591
Hello there.

05:22.671 --> 05:26.471
[MIZUKI] <i>Wow! Okay, tuxedo Sano</i>
<i>is, like, gorgeous.</i>

05:26.551 --> 05:27.471
SLAM

05:27.561 --> 05:28.971
Mizuki, you look
so freaking cute!

05:29.061 --> 05:29.971
-[thumps]
-[Nakatsu grunts]

05:30.061 --> 05:32.851
But it's true.
That dress looks red hot on you.

05:32.941 --> 05:34.691
It's crazy how real
your boobs look.

05:34.771 --> 05:37.231
[Mizuki chuckles]
<i>They'd better look real.</i>

05:38.441 --> 05:41.031
You're looking
pretty sharp yourself. Uh?

05:42.111 --> 05:43.071
Uh?

05:46.781 --> 05:47.781
Huh?

05:48.451 --> 05:50.871
[♪ ballroom music playing]

05:51.581 --> 05:53.371
[MIZUKI] You're kidding.

05:53.461 --> 05:55.631
It's like
something out of a fairy tale!

05:55.711 --> 05:57.291
Aw, man.
All of a sudden,

05:57.381 --> 05:59.551
I feel like a big dork
in cosplay or something.

05:59.631 --> 06:01.051
I know exactly what you mean.

06:01.131 --> 06:02.631
[BOY 1] Please share
this dance with me?

06:02.721 --> 06:04.091
I came to ask the same.

06:04.171 --> 06:06.511
Oh, no,
whatever is a girl to do?

06:06.591 --> 06:08.011
[MIZUKI] Surprise, surprise.

06:08.101 --> 06:10.391
Looks like one of us
is blending in just fine.

06:11.021 --> 06:12.311
There's Nanba.

06:12.391 --> 06:14.521
[KADOMA] He's swarmed by girls,
as usual.

06:14.601 --> 06:15.941
I'd bet big money

06:16.021 --> 06:18.401
those pests get eradicated
in 0.5 seconds.

06:18.481 --> 06:19.901
Just what do you mean by that?

06:20.441 --> 06:21.901
[MIZUKI] Stand back and watch.

06:22.281 --> 06:24.031
There's my dashing prince!

06:24.111 --> 06:25.741
[evil chuckle]

06:25.861 --> 06:27.161
[MIZUKI] Told you.

06:28.241 --> 06:30.331
<i>I wonder where Sano ran off to.</i>

06:30.741 --> 06:33.041
[HIMEJIMA] Hello,
my sweet little lambs.

06:33.121 --> 06:34.371
[both groan softly]

06:34.461 --> 06:35.501
♪

06:36.711 --> 06:38.251
[speaking in German]

06:38.331 --> 06:39.671
[both groan]

06:40.541 --> 06:41.921
[in English] This is a warning.

06:42.011 --> 06:44.341
If you boys keep dressing
like yummy little tarts,

06:44.421 --> 06:47.181
you might just get snatched up
and eaten by the big bad wolf.

06:47.261 --> 06:48.431
[Kujo fake laughs]

06:49.011 --> 06:50.931
It doesn't sound
like a joke coming from you.

06:51.011 --> 06:53.431
Don't startle me!
You know I'm jumpy!

06:53.521 --> 06:55.101
[BOTH] Kujo's such a good guy!

06:55.191 --> 06:56.941
Listen,
this one's my dance partner,

06:57.021 --> 06:59.191
so don't bug him.
That's my job this evening.

06:59.981 --> 07:01.361
Hey, since we're both here,

07:01.441 --> 07:02.821
wanna practice the dance
with me?

07:02.901 --> 07:04.441
[KADOMA] Oh...

07:04.531 --> 07:06.701
Sure. And osu!

07:06.781 --> 07:07.951
[MIZUKI]
<i>You can't just whip out</i>

07:08.031 --> 07:09.991
<i>the karate stuff</i>
<i>dressed like that.</i>

07:11.031 --> 07:14.001
[girls exclaim] Handsome Oscar!

07:14.121 --> 07:15.371
[speaking German]

07:15.461 --> 07:16.911
-[in English] Please.
-[Mizuki sighs]

07:17.001 --> 07:18.961
[RIO] Hey, there you are.

07:19.041 --> 07:21.591
I've been looking
all over the ballroom for you.

07:21.671 --> 07:24.011
-Hi, Rio.
-Where've you been tonight?

07:24.091 --> 07:25.841
You weren't
in the changing room earlier.

07:25.921 --> 07:27.671
Oh, right. I don't know.

07:27.761 --> 07:29.591
<i>I had to change in the bathroom.</i>

07:29.681 --> 07:31.641
Kanna gave me this
to give to you.

07:31.721 --> 07:32.681
Huh? What is it?

07:32.761 --> 07:33.851
Hold still for a sec.

07:33.931 --> 07:35.851
Everyone's already
wearing theirs,

07:35.931 --> 07:37.691
but you weren't around,
so...

07:37.771 --> 07:39.651
There. All done!

07:41.191 --> 07:43.401
Those flowers look
so sweet on you, Mizuki!

07:43.481 --> 07:44.731
If I didn't know any better,

07:44.821 --> 07:46.241
I would think you were
really a girl.

07:46.321 --> 07:48.111
Oh, yeah? Well, that's silly.

07:48.201 --> 07:49.491
[Rio sighs]

07:50.161 --> 07:51.241
I'm sorry.

07:51.321 --> 07:52.831
Why? Is something wrong?

07:52.911 --> 07:55.501
I feel sort of bad
that I got paired up with Sano.

07:55.791 --> 07:57.041
[gasps]

07:57.121 --> 07:58.161
[yelps]

07:58.251 --> 07:59.871
Sorry I know your secret.

07:59.961 --> 08:02.631
As Umeda's little sister,
I get all the hot gossip.

08:02.711 --> 08:04.841
It's hard when the person
you have a crush on

08:04.921 --> 08:06.341
is, like, the hottest guy, huh?

08:06.421 --> 08:07.841
Bet you've gotta
watch him like a hawk.

08:07.921 --> 08:08.881
What?

08:08.971 --> 08:11.141
I caught a glimpse of Sano
out in the crowd.

08:11.221 --> 08:13.431
<i>He was being swarmed by girls</i>.

08:13.511 --> 08:15.061
He kept trying to get away.

08:15.141 --> 08:16.891
[Mizuki gasps] <i>Yeah,</i>
<i>that sounds like him.</i>

08:16.971 --> 08:19.391
[RIO] I feel for you, Mizuki,
I do.

08:19.771 --> 08:21.651
I've been around the block
with my bro,

08:21.731 --> 08:23.481
so I've got no problem
with this kind of stuff.

08:23.571 --> 08:24.901
Uh, okay.

08:24.981 --> 08:26.111
[RIO] Good luck!

08:26.191 --> 08:28.951
I'm rooting for you!
See you later!

08:29.031 --> 08:31.161
[MIZUKI]
<i>You have no idea whatsoever.</i>

08:32.531 --> 08:33.661
[groans]

08:34.701 --> 08:36.831
<i>So, the girls</i>
<i>are flocking to him?</i>

08:38.001 --> 08:40.331
[NAKATSU] Hey, Mizuki,
I was looking for you.

08:40.411 --> 08:41.581
[MIZUKI] Uh?

08:41.671 --> 08:43.751
What's with the mopey face,
my friend?

08:43.841 --> 08:44.921
[MIZUKI] It's nothing.

08:46.251 --> 08:48.671
Would you like to dance,
my queen? With me?

08:49.881 --> 08:50.921
[Mizuki chuckles]

08:51.801 --> 08:53.051
-Sounds fun.
-[Nakatsu gasps]

08:53.141 --> 08:54.051
♪

08:54.141 --> 08:55.761
[both chuckle]

08:59.561 --> 09:01.441
[NAKATSU] <i>Crap, I can't help it.</i>

09:01.521 --> 09:04.441
<i>I know I shouldn't,</i>
<i>but I keep staring!</i>

09:04.521 --> 09:07.481
<i>Is it even my fault</i>
<i>when they look that real?</i>

09:08.651 --> 09:10.191
-[MIZUKI] Uh, Nakatsu?
-[gasps]

09:10.281 --> 09:11.321
Right here.

09:11.401 --> 09:13.821
Check it out. Looks like
Hibari's gonna dance now.

09:13.911 --> 09:16.371
[NAKATSU] <i>Oh.</i>
<i>Wonder how those bazoombas</i>

09:16.451 --> 09:18.241
<i>are gonna move</i>
<i>on the dance floor.</i>

09:18.331 --> 09:20.201
<i>Oh, no!</i>
<i>Now that I've noticed them,</i>

09:20.291 --> 09:23.121
<i>they're all I can think about.</i>
<i>Control yourself, soldier.</i>

09:23.211 --> 09:25.341
<i>Forget aboob it... Crap!</i>

09:25.421 --> 09:27.461
Boobies!

09:27.541 --> 09:29.341
Oh, my gosh, are you okay?

09:30.221 --> 09:31.971
Whoa, what's wrong
with him, Ashiya?

09:32.051 --> 09:35.141
I think Hibari's sex appeal was
too much for him and he fainted.

09:35.221 --> 09:36.641
Lost lots of blood, too.

09:36.721 --> 09:37.851
[NAKATSU] Kill me!

09:41.431 --> 09:43.521
[MIZUKI] Is he going to be okay?

09:46.941 --> 09:47.861
[splashes]

09:47.941 --> 09:49.611
[Rio gasps] Mizuki!

09:49.691 --> 09:53.361
Oh, no! Your dress is soaked.
Who'd do such a mean thing?

09:53.451 --> 09:54.361
[BOY] That's low.

09:54.451 --> 09:56.621
-[GIRL] What a shame. Poor girl.
-[Mizuki groans]

09:56.701 --> 09:57.911
<i>Guess they got me.</i>

09:57.991 --> 09:58.991
-[SANO] Ashiya.
-Uh?

09:59.081 --> 10:00.161
[MIZUKI] Sano.

10:00.251 --> 10:02.041
Man, that was completely
uncalled for.

10:02.121 --> 10:03.581
Did anyone see who did it?

10:03.661 --> 10:06.251
[RIO] No, but they purposefully
ruined his dress.

10:06.331 --> 10:08.541
It's fine, I'm okay! I promise.

10:08.631 --> 10:11.761
I'll go try and wash it out now.
Please, just give me one moment.

10:11.841 --> 10:12.761
[SANO] Wait.

10:13.301 --> 10:14.551
[MIZUKI] <i>How embarrassing.</i>

10:14.631 --> 10:16.511
<i>I don't want Sano</i>
<i>to see me like this.</i>

10:18.601 --> 10:19.971
[water splashing]

10:23.351 --> 10:25.101
[MIZUKI] <i>It's still stained.</i>

10:25.481 --> 10:27.021
<i>I won't cry, though,</i>

10:27.111 --> 10:28.691
<i>-not over this.</i>
-[door opens]

10:28.771 --> 10:29.901
-[RIO] How's it look?
-Uh?

10:29.981 --> 10:31.741
[MIZUKI] No luck. It's ruined.

10:31.821 --> 10:33.151
But it is what it is, so...

10:33.241 --> 10:34.491
[YUMEMI] That stain's set.

10:34.571 --> 10:35.901
Wow, it sure is,

10:35.991 --> 10:38.241
and it looks like
a really gnarly one, too.

10:39.991 --> 10:43.041
We can fix this.
Just let us take care of it.

10:43.121 --> 10:44.331
[MIZUKI] Uh...

10:44.411 --> 10:46.121
Sure. Thanks.

10:48.211 --> 10:50.501
[ANNOUNCER] <i>And now</i>
<i>the highlight of the night.</i>

10:50.591 --> 10:51.671
<i>Find your partners.</i>

10:51.761 --> 10:53.671
<i>This dance will decide</i>
<i>our king, queen,</i>

10:53.761 --> 10:55.511
<i>and best couple of the year.</i>

10:55.591 --> 10:57.141
[♪ ballroom music playing]

10:57.221 --> 10:59.051
[NIHONBASHI]
The dance might be a huge drag,

10:59.141 --> 11:02.141
but my camera can always
handle the exposure! [giggles]

11:02.221 --> 11:04.141
I know I didn't get a date

11:04.231 --> 11:06.601
but why am I the one
stuck dancing with Nakao?

11:06.691 --> 11:07.981
Dancing with any other guy

11:08.061 --> 11:10.611
than the one and only Nanba
is a dagger to my heart!

11:10.691 --> 11:13.151
You know,
I actually have feelings, too.

11:13.231 --> 11:14.401
♪

11:16.071 --> 11:17.781
[MIZUKI]
<i>They fixed my dress for me,</i>

11:17.861 --> 11:20.281
<i>but my dance partner</i>
<i>was medically evacuated.</i>

11:20.371 --> 11:21.281
[ANNOUNCER]
<i>Ladies and gents,</i>

11:21.371 --> 11:23.371
<i>it's officially our last dance</i>
<i>of the night.</i>

11:23.451 --> 11:24.411
[Mizuki gasps]

11:25.161 --> 11:27.791
[MIZUKI] <i>I'm still a part</i>
<i>of a fancy Christmas ball.</i>

11:27.871 --> 11:30.171
<i>Might as well make the best</i>
<i>of it and have some fun.</i>

11:30.251 --> 11:31.921
♪

11:35.261 --> 11:36.421
[RIO] Uh?

11:36.921 --> 11:38.131
[SANO] <i>Ashiya.</i>

11:39.011 --> 11:41.721
If you're that worried about him
then you should go check in.

11:41.801 --> 11:42.851
-Huh?
-I promise

11:42.931 --> 11:44.971
that I'm okay on my own.
You better hurry,

11:45.101 --> 11:46.931
or someone else might
steal him from you.

11:47.021 --> 11:48.231
Pardon me.

11:49.311 --> 11:50.441
[chuckles]

11:52.401 --> 11:54.021
[MIZUKI] Uh? Sano?

11:55.321 --> 11:56.321
Uh?

11:57.401 --> 11:58.951
Huh? Sano?

12:01.531 --> 12:02.951
Mm...

12:03.741 --> 12:05.661
[SANO] I want to dance with you.

12:05.751 --> 12:07.961
Being a wallflower
is no fun at all.

12:08.041 --> 12:09.751
Yeah, but I thought...

12:10.421 --> 12:14.091
[RIO] Go. Go. Go.
Go. Go. Go. Go!

12:14.631 --> 12:16.211
[SANO] So, what do you say?

12:16.301 --> 12:18.091
You still feel like dancing?

12:20.971 --> 12:23.351
I do. I really do.

12:23.431 --> 12:24.351
[gasps]

12:25.521 --> 12:26.601
Me too.

12:28.061 --> 12:29.351
[Mizuki breathes softly]

12:29.441 --> 12:31.401
-Here we go.
-Mm...

12:31.811 --> 12:33.111
Don't look away.

12:33.191 --> 12:35.441
-Wait, I can't do this.
-Why can't you?

12:35.521 --> 12:38.491
I'm all red! Everyone will see
and think we're acting weird.

12:39.531 --> 12:41.991
-Dummy, that doesn't matter.
-[breathes softly]

12:42.071 --> 12:44.121
It's only one little dance.

12:44.201 --> 12:45.371
That's no biggie, right?

12:45.451 --> 12:46.491
♪

12:47.121 --> 12:48.331
[chuckles softly]

12:51.421 --> 12:53.291
[Yumemi exclaims] Aw, look.

12:53.381 --> 12:54.841
[KANNA] My... how precious.

12:54.921 --> 12:57.631
In my eyes, dear,
you're 100 times more precious!

12:57.711 --> 12:59.381
Oh, my goodness,
those two are crushing it!

12:59.471 --> 13:00.971
They look like
the perfect couple.

13:01.051 --> 13:03.141
You'll trip
if you let your eyes wander.

13:03.221 --> 13:04.431
♪

13:18.531 --> 13:20.901
[HIBARI] My, look
at that hummingbird go.

13:20.991 --> 13:22.951
This is going to be
a much tougher competition

13:23.031 --> 13:24.781
than we thought.
Too bad for them.

13:24.871 --> 13:26.241
My thoughts exactly.

13:26.331 --> 13:29.041
[HIBARI] <i>Face it, Hibari!</i>
<i>Dancing with him is the only way</i>

13:29.121 --> 13:30.701
<i>to show the world</i>
<i>you're not just beautiful,</i>

13:30.791 --> 13:31.751
<i>but talented!</i>

13:31.831 --> 13:33.001
[HIMEJIMA]
<i>You must endure, Oscar.</i>

13:33.121 --> 13:34.331
<i>Dancing with her is the only way</i>

13:34.421 --> 13:36.541
<i>to show the world</i>
<i>your true grace and skill!</i>

13:36.671 --> 13:38.171
<i>It'll be over</i>
<i>before you know it.</i>

13:38.711 --> 13:40.471
[ANNOUNCER] <i>May I have</i>
<i>your attention, please?</i>

13:40.551 --> 13:42.671
<i>It's time to announce</i>
<i>this year's lucky winners</i>

13:42.761 --> 13:44.591
<i>-selected by your votes.</i>
-This doesn't concern us.

13:44.681 --> 13:46.681
-You wanna get lost?
-You know it.

13:47.301 --> 13:49.311
[ANNOUNCER] <i>We will begin</i>
<i>by announcing our queen.</i>

13:49.391 --> 13:51.181
[MIZUKI] Do you mind
waiting here for one sec?

13:51.271 --> 13:52.181
[SANO] Mm.

13:52.641 --> 13:53.941
Hm?

13:54.021 --> 13:56.231
[MIZUKI] Surprise, it's for you.

13:56.311 --> 13:57.441
What is it?

13:57.521 --> 14:00.361
[chuckles] Well, tomorrow
is your birthday, isn't it?

14:00.441 --> 14:01.781
I may be a whole day early,

14:01.861 --> 14:03.451
but I got you a little
something-something.

14:03.531 --> 14:04.451
♪

14:04.531 --> 14:06.991
Somehow, the big day
slipped my mind last year.

14:07.071 --> 14:09.741
So, this year,
I swore it wouldn't.

14:09.831 --> 14:12.451
I wanted to be the first
to wish you happy birthday.

14:12.541 --> 14:13.751
[SANO] Huh.

14:13.831 --> 14:14.961
♪

14:16.331 --> 14:17.461
[MIZUKI] Uh?

14:17.541 --> 14:18.631
♪

14:19.131 --> 14:21.461
Wait, is this snow?
This is so cool!

14:21.551 --> 14:23.631
It's snowing, Sano.

14:23.721 --> 14:25.051
[SANO] You're like a little kid.

14:25.141 --> 14:26.721
This is my first time
seeing snow.

14:26.801 --> 14:29.141
What the heck do you want
from me? It's awesome.

14:29.221 --> 14:31.221
-[SANO] Seriously?
-Seriously.

14:31.311 --> 14:32.851
It's so cold.

14:33.811 --> 14:36.731
Whoa, it melts so fast. Ah...

14:37.651 --> 14:38.981
[Sano chuckles softly]

14:39.061 --> 14:40.981
You're going to
catch a cold, goober.

14:41.071 --> 14:42.071
[MIZUKI] Uh?

14:42.571 --> 14:43.821
[Mizuki chuckles]

14:45.361 --> 14:47.241
Happy birthday to you, Sano.

14:48.491 --> 14:49.701
[SANO] Thank you.

14:51.581 --> 14:53.541
[indistinct chatter]

14:55.621 --> 14:56.791
[Umeda sighs]

14:58.081 --> 14:59.091
[exhales]

14:59.171 --> 15:00.501
Looks like it's going to stick.

15:00.591 --> 15:02.011
[AKIHA] You need someone
to warm you up?

15:02.091 --> 15:04.261
-Hello, Doctor!
-You're kidding!

15:04.341 --> 15:06.261
What are you even doing here?
Let go of me!

15:06.341 --> 15:08.341
[Akiha laughs]
It's almost Christmas.

15:08.431 --> 15:10.721
Can Santa's good boy
crash at your place?

15:10.801 --> 15:12.471
[UMEDA] Absolutely not.

15:13.601 --> 15:14.731
[barks]

15:16.101 --> 15:19.191
-[massager buzzing]
-So relaxing.

15:19.271 --> 15:20.361
Are you for real?

15:20.441 --> 15:22.901
Wasn't that supposed
to be my birthday present?

15:22.981 --> 15:24.741
[chuckles]

15:24.821 --> 15:26.241
But I can't stop myself.

15:26.321 --> 15:27.281
[Sano sighs]

15:27.781 --> 15:29.371
I may be a whole day early,

15:29.451 --> 15:31.081
but I got you
a little something.

15:34.791 --> 15:36.961
[SANO] <i>An ultrasonic massager!</i>

15:37.041 --> 15:38.711
<i>Kinda geriatric.</i>

15:38.831 --> 15:40.381
They're usually 15,000 yen,

15:40.461 --> 15:43.211
but I found this one
for only 4,000. [chuckles]

15:43.301 --> 15:44.671
Who cares how much it cost?

15:44.761 --> 15:47.091
It was more than worth
the money I spent on it.

15:47.171 --> 15:49.471
[Sano chuckles]
I told you, I love it.

15:52.391 --> 15:53.681
Thanks a lot.

15:54.601 --> 15:56.731
[Mizuki gasps, exclaims]

15:56.811 --> 15:59.691
<i>He put his chin on my shoulder.</i>
<i>I can't even</i>

15:59.771 --> 16:00.981
<i>-think straight now.</i>
-[phone vibrates]

16:01.061 --> 16:02.361
JULIA

16:02.861 --> 16:04.191
Julia's calling me.

16:04.271 --> 16:06.491
Mizuki! Who wants some taiyaki?

16:06.571 --> 16:07.491
[gasps]

16:07.571 --> 16:08.991
-I do.
-Yay, I want some too.

16:09.071 --> 16:09.991
CLINGY

16:11.781 --> 16:13.371
[Nakatsu chuckles]

16:13.451 --> 16:15.411
Normally, I'd come in
with my patented

16:15.501 --> 16:17.121
"get your hands off
Mizuki tackle,"

16:17.201 --> 16:19.871
but that's the old me.
I'm a brand-new man now.

16:19.961 --> 16:22.131
Watch out, cause I'm manning up
to the max!

16:22.211 --> 16:24.041
<i>Prepare yourselves to be amazed:</i>

16:24.131 --> 16:26.631
<i>it's the Super Macho</i>
<i>Nakatsu Revolution!</i>

16:26.721 --> 16:28.511
Wait! Your heart
will skip a beat for me--

16:28.591 --> 16:30.261
Hey, Julia, what's going on
with you?

16:30.341 --> 16:31.261
[Nakatsu screams]

16:31.341 --> 16:33.261
<i>Oh, you know me, I'm chilling.</i>

16:33.351 --> 16:35.141
<i>Do you have a quick sec</i>
<i>to spill some tea?</i>

16:35.221 --> 16:37.641
<i>I wanna get the deets</i>
<i>on what happened at the ball.</i>

16:37.731 --> 16:39.311
Uh? [chuckles]

16:39.391 --> 16:40.481
We'll talk later.

16:40.561 --> 16:43.771
Hi. It's been way too long,
Little Miss America.

16:43.861 --> 16:46.111
<i>And I see you're still</i>
<i>as annoying as ever,</i>

16:46.191 --> 16:47.901
<i>you big, dumb ape. Get bent.</i>

16:47.991 --> 16:49.741
Just who do you think you are?

16:49.821 --> 16:51.411
-[NANBA] Hey, guys.
-[ALL] Mm?

16:51.491 --> 16:54.121
My grandma gave me some tickets
to the ice-skating rink.

16:54.201 --> 16:55.411
Anyone wanna go?

16:55.491 --> 16:57.411
[BOTH] Oh, hell yeah!

16:57.501 --> 16:59.041
<i>Is that creeper there?</i>

16:59.121 --> 17:01.081
Sounds like you've missed me.

17:01.171 --> 17:03.541
It's been months
since you've had to leave, love,

17:03.631 --> 17:05.051
and you have no idea

17:05.131 --> 17:06.801
-how lonely I've been--
-Uh? She hung up.

17:06.881 --> 17:08.171
[Nakatsu chuckles]

17:08.261 --> 17:09.341
♪

17:10.761 --> 17:12.681
[both exclaiming]

17:12.761 --> 17:16.181
Hey, Nakatsu, what're you doing
by yourself over there, huh?

17:16.261 --> 17:18.561
-Let's goof off together!
-Yeah, yeah, I hear you.

17:18.641 --> 17:20.731
Hey, everyone,
check out this dork on ice

17:20.811 --> 17:22.561
-who can't skate!
-[both chuckle]

17:22.651 --> 17:23.561
Can it, morons.

17:23.651 --> 17:25.651
Kansai people don't ice skate!

17:25.731 --> 17:27.111
Get me on skis or a snowboard

17:27.191 --> 17:29.361
in the Lake Biwa valley
and watch me shred!

17:29.441 --> 17:31.701
I can even ski blindfolded,
I'll have you know!

17:31.781 --> 17:33.821
Being able to skate
with his legs akimbo

17:33.911 --> 17:35.201
is a talent all its own.

17:37.041 --> 17:39.201
[KAYASHIMA] Looks like
Ashiya's a real natural.

17:39.291 --> 17:41.331
[SANO]
Just like a fish in the water.

17:41.411 --> 17:42.581
[Nakatsu grunts]

17:43.081 --> 17:44.331
He's not the only fish.

17:44.421 --> 17:46.631
Look who else is totally
in their element on the ice.

17:46.711 --> 17:48.501
Oh, my gosh,
you're from that PuPa ad.

17:48.591 --> 17:49.841
I'd recognize you anywhere!

17:49.921 --> 17:52.221
[GIRL 2] Wow, you look
even hotter in person!

17:52.301 --> 17:54.011
He's wearing the coat
from the shoot.

17:54.091 --> 17:55.971
What a sad little
attention whore.

17:56.051 --> 17:58.891
He's resorting to smoke
and mirrors, I see.

18:01.061 --> 18:03.351
-There's my favorite guy.
-[Nanba gasps]

18:03.441 --> 18:05.691
Don't forget you promised me
that we would hold hands

18:05.771 --> 18:06.941
while we skate together.

18:08.481 --> 18:09.981
You're such a naughty boy.

18:10.571 --> 18:12.491
[GIRLS] Whoa, we give up.

18:13.071 --> 18:14.991
[NAKAO] Come with me, darling.

18:15.071 --> 18:17.491
[sighs] Well,
I guess this is my life now.

18:17.581 --> 18:19.831
Did you see that?
Nakao's got real game.

18:19.911 --> 18:20.951
What a genius move.

18:21.041 --> 18:22.501
That was so cunning
and calculated,

18:22.581 --> 18:24.501
those girls had no clue
they were being played.

18:24.581 --> 18:27.001
[MIZUKI] Hey,
what you guys talking about?

18:27.091 --> 18:28.211
Yeah, I know.

18:28.291 --> 18:30.921
Nakao has chosen
quite a difficult path in life.

18:31.001 --> 18:32.011
After all,

18:32.091 --> 18:33.671
<i>ever since Nanba</i>
<i>was crowned king,</i>

18:33.761 --> 18:35.681
<i>the competition has been stiff.</i>

18:35.761 --> 18:37.641
[NAKATSU] So, the players
gotta get smart.

18:37.721 --> 18:40.061
Did anybody else think
that Hibari was a lot?

18:40.141 --> 18:41.181
What, she's perfect!

18:41.641 --> 18:44.021
<i>She totally deserved</i>
<i>to be crowned queen!</i>

18:44.811 --> 18:46.981
Okay, that's not what I meant.

18:47.061 --> 18:48.611
[GIRLS] Hail Hibari!

18:48.731 --> 18:49.861
Hail Hibari!

18:50.031 --> 18:51.651
Hail Hibari!

18:51.731 --> 18:54.241
Well, you know, I'm convinced
they rigged the votes

18:54.321 --> 18:56.821
so that only one of the
St. Blossom girls would win.

18:56.911 --> 18:59.531
Mm-hmm. Honestly, I thought
Ashiya was way prettier

18:59.621 --> 19:00.911
than all those Blossom girls.

19:00.991 --> 19:02.161
My new rival.

19:02.241 --> 19:04.961
[laughs] That's very sweet
of you, but get real.

19:05.041 --> 19:06.921
What? I don't get it. I mean...

19:07.501 --> 19:10.301
you two won the special award
for best couple.

19:10.631 --> 19:13.421
[MIZUKI] <i>Oh, yeah.</i>
<i>That was kinda amazing.</i>

19:13.511 --> 19:16.301
<i>I never thought I'd win an award</i>
<i>with the Izumi Sano!</i>

19:16.381 --> 19:17.841
That's true.
But it's not like

19:17.931 --> 19:20.101
that was a super official award
or anything.

19:20.181 --> 19:22.061
Tennoji and Kanna
were the happy duo

19:22.141 --> 19:23.931
that won
the real best couple award.

19:24.021 --> 19:25.271
[Nakatsu cries]

19:25.351 --> 19:26.851
<i>I've only got myself to blame!</i>

19:26.941 --> 19:28.401
<i>I'm such a stupid loser.</i>

19:28.481 --> 19:30.321
<i>If only I hadn't passed out</i>
<i>on the dance floor,</i>

19:30.401 --> 19:32.571
<i>Mizuki and I could've</i>
<i>easily won that award!</i>

19:32.691 --> 19:34.071
-Dummy.
-Huh?

19:34.611 --> 19:35.941
-Kyomi?
-Hm.

19:36.031 --> 19:38.411
Hey, cutie,
what are you doing here?

19:38.491 --> 19:41.491
Kyomi, I said
don't let go of my hand.

19:41.581 --> 19:43.451
[Nakatsu chuckles] Kagurazaka?

19:43.541 --> 19:46.371
Well, look at you over here,
being the perfect big brother.

19:46.461 --> 19:48.171
Sorry? The hell are you
even talking about?

19:48.251 --> 19:50.841
-[TAMAMI] Sister attack!
-Tamami came to skate, too?

19:50.921 --> 19:51.961
Wait, what?

19:52.051 --> 19:53.591
-We haven't seen you in ages!
-[speaking indistinctly]

19:53.671 --> 19:54.591
That's right.

19:54.671 --> 19:55.671
[Tamami gasps]

19:58.091 --> 20:01.011
What a co-inky dink!
It's so good to see you, Mizuki.

20:01.101 --> 20:02.311
And what's up, Izumi?

20:02.391 --> 20:03.851
You're going
to the next meet, right?

20:03.931 --> 20:04.971
I'll be cheerin' for you!

20:05.061 --> 20:06.351
See you later!

20:07.641 --> 20:11.111
Me too. You better not get
some lame-ass score though.

20:11.191 --> 20:13.111
I'll try my best.

20:16.441 --> 20:17.861
[KAGURAZAKA] Well, let's go.

20:19.201 --> 20:20.621
High five me first.

20:20.701 --> 20:22.331
-[KYOMI] Uh?
-[NAKATSU] Atta girl!

20:25.201 --> 20:26.371
[MIZUKI] You're kidding.

20:26.451 --> 20:28.121
Rio's parents are here!

20:28.211 --> 20:29.121
Oh, my!

20:29.211 --> 20:31.381
You two sure look like
you're having a good time.

20:31.461 --> 20:34.421
[SEIRA] You know it.
The tickets expire today.

20:34.501 --> 20:37.841
Wait, that would make them
Dr. Umeda's folks too, right?

20:37.921 --> 20:39.091
[NAKATSU] They're in their 50s.

20:39.221 --> 20:40.681
Must have discovered
the fountain of youth.

20:40.761 --> 20:43.721
[NAKAO] Nanba, wait for me.
I wanna slow skate some more.

20:43.811 --> 20:46.601
Hold on. I'd know that
shaggy head anywhere!

20:46.681 --> 20:47.891
Is that you, Minami?

20:47.981 --> 20:50.231
Wait, what?
You guys are here too.

20:50.311 --> 20:52.021
Hey, Grandma and Gramps.

20:52.111 --> 20:54.901
Grandma?
And you call him Gramps?

20:54.981 --> 20:57.031
-[BOTH] But she's so young.
-[BOTH] And so is he.

20:57.111 --> 20:59.031
[ALL] Nanba's their grandson?

20:59.111 --> 21:01.071
Then that would mean Io is...

21:01.161 --> 21:03.321
-And Umeda is...
-That would make Rio his...

21:03.411 --> 21:05.201
-What's up, guys?
-Lost in your thoughts?

21:05.291 --> 21:08.501
Not quite. Just family math.
Somehow, Rio's Nanba's aunt.

21:08.581 --> 21:10.331
[MIZUKI]
<i>The cat's out of the bag!</i>

21:10.411 --> 21:12.291
<i>-I'm so sorry, Rio!</i>
-[SEKIME] Aunt? His aunt?

21:12.381 --> 21:14.001
[SEIRA] Oh, come on, Minami.

21:14.091 --> 21:15.711
How many times
do I have to ask you

21:15.801 --> 21:18.211
to call us Mama Seira
and Papa Azuma?

21:18.341 --> 21:19.301
[AZUMA] My darling.

21:19.971 --> 21:21.301
Let me hold you.

21:21.841 --> 21:23.301
[gasps]

21:23.391 --> 21:25.471
Oh, Azuma, hon!

21:26.011 --> 21:28.181
[ALL] Aw, they're
still lovebirds.

21:28.311 --> 21:29.771
Just in case you boys forgot,

21:29.851 --> 21:31.271
those two won
the best couple award

21:31.351 --> 21:33.191
at the joint ball
back in their day.

21:36.071 --> 21:38.861
[MIZUKI] <i>Dr. Umeda said</i>
<i>whoever gets voted best couple</i>

21:38.941 --> 21:41.201
<i>supposedly lives</i>
<i>happily ever after.</i>

21:41.821 --> 21:43.701
<i>I can't just write it off</i>
<i>as superstition</i>

21:43.781 --> 21:45.951
<i>after witnessing</i>
<i>the two of them together.</i>

21:46.991 --> 21:48.121
[both gasp]

21:48.701 --> 21:50.581
Close call, but I got you.

21:50.661 --> 21:52.211
[MIZUKI] Thank you.

21:52.291 --> 21:54.001
[SANO] You have to be
extra careful.

21:54.081 --> 21:55.961
It's really slippery
at the edge of the rink.

21:56.591 --> 21:58.961
-Come on, let's go around again.
-Huh?

21:59.051 --> 22:00.211
[grunts]

22:00.511 --> 22:02.471
[NAKATSU] Hey!
What am I, chopped liver?

22:02.551 --> 22:03.641
♪

22:06.141 --> 22:09.221
[MIZUKI] <i>Maybe a bit of</i>
<i>the superstition will rub off.</i>

22:09.311 --> 22:12.101
<i>I mean, we did win</i>
<i>best couple, after all.</i>

22:13.651 --> 22:14.731
[Sano exhales]

22:14.811 --> 22:15.861
[Mizuki chuckles softly]

22:17.071 --> 22:17.981
♪

22:18.531 --> 22:19.481
[Mizuki chuckles]

22:20.191 --> 22:22.491
<i>I've never been</i>
<i>this happy before.</i>

22:22.571 --> 22:24.991
<i>That's got everything</i>
<i>to do with him.</i>

22:25.071 --> 22:28.031
<i>I hope Sano and I</i>
<i>are always together.</i>

22:30.621 --> 22:32.661
[♪ closing theme song playing]
